    <Canvas Id="Roygb3bQuVqK15xRv6xKxz" DefaultCategory="Globe" CanvasType="FullCategory">
      <Node Name="GlobeWindow" Bounds="100,220" Id="VBrh8tKkQ1kPaTaEgq0sJb" Summary="A window that shows a globe. The mouse moves it." Remarks="Connect OpenStreetMap to Input and switch Enabled on: left drag moves the globe, the wheel zooms, right drag turns and tilts.&#xD;&#xA;More layers (VectorTiles, FeatureLayer, Geometry, more tiles) through Group: leftmost at the bottom.&#xD;&#xA;Scene: Stride entities shown with the globe, e.g. from Group [Stride].&#xD;&#xA;Cursor is the mouse in projection space, for ScreenToGlobe.&#xD;&#xA;To share the window with other scenes, use GlobeCamera, Globe, Drag and ZoomByWheel instead." Tags="renderer,window,globe,map">
